OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FShowers and brighter spells.
OL,6,FBest of shelter expected to east of
OL,7,FGlasgow. Showers building from the
OL,8,Fwest into the afternoon, with some
OL,9,Fturning heavier and bringing the risk
OL,10,Fof later thunderstorms to Argyll and
OL,11,Fareas from Glasgow westwards. Brisk
OL,12,Fwinds.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FShowers becoming confined to
OL,15,FArgyll by late evening, as clear
OL,16,Fspells develop. Cloud increasing
OL,17,Fovernight in Argyll, bringing patchy
OL,18,Frain here by dawn. Southerly winds
OL,19,Fstrengthening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
