OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FWindy. Most staying dry
OL,6,Fthrough to mid-afternoon with some
OL,7,Flimited early brightness. Patchy rain
OL,8,Fin Argyll developing and extending to
OL,9,Fthe rest of the area late afternoon to
OL,10,Fearly evening.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FEarly
OL,13,Frain Thursday, clearing erratically as
OL,14,Fbrighter spells and showers feed from
OL,15,Fthe northwest. Showers for Friday,
OL,16,Ffocused in west. Saturday mainly dry,
OL,17,Foccasionally bright.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
